# Anger: "As long as this card is in your graveyard and you control a Mountain, creatures you control have haste." With
# Anger in Bot1's hand the Goblin Welder has no haste although Bot1 controls a Mountain (the Blood Crypt, a Swamp
# Mountain by its land types, no card named Mountain); discarded to hand size on turn 7, Anger is in the graveyard and
# the same Welder has haste.

[Bot1 Deck]
Blood Crypt
Goblin Welder
Anger
Swamp x4
Swamp x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Blood Crypt.Play
Bot1.Accept
Bot1.Battlefield.Blood Crypt.Activate(Ability: {R})
Bot1.Hand.Goblin Welder.Cast
[T1 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Welder.Keywords = (absent)
[T7 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Discard(Anger)
[T8 Bot2.Main1]
? Bot1.Graveyard = Anger
? Bot1.Battlefield.Goblin Welder.Keywords = Haste

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Anger
